// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL4_MI_Burke_Cape_Mission 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - LongbowWatchList 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P1249585820" "Longbow Watch List"
// DetailString :
"P731637498" "You find on the Longbow Commander a hand-held computer. It contains information on villain activities in the Rogue Isles, including Family smuggling operations and movement of villains into Paragon City. You're included on the watch list! It looks like Longbow might be monitoring your activities!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - HeroCape 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P3206262587" "Hero Cape"
// DetailString :
"P3876576997" "This is a cape taken from one of the heroes of Paragon City you defeated in combat! Take this back to Fortunata Kalinda back in the Rogue Isles to prove yourself worthy as a destined one of Lord Recluse!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P3359848300" "So it's you again, {VillainName}! I see you've made a name for yourself on the Rogue Isles. That's good, 'cause a merc is only as good as his rep.<br><br>You probably already know Lord Recluse has forbidden any of his so-called 'Destined Ones' to wear a cape until they've proven themselves. Now I don't really care what Recluse or his footsoldiers want, but I understand there's certain status symbols which people strive for. In this case, you're gonna need to play by Arachnos' rules. If you want to earn yourself a cape, I'll tell you what you need to do to get it. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Head over to Paragon City, destroy a couple of their hero statues, and steal the cape from any hero who tries to stop you!</A>"
// HeadlineString :
"P182958024" "Steal cape from hero"
// SendOffString :
"P1048368184" "You will need to secure passage to Paragon City and be smuggled over to one of their statue parks. Go speak with Lorenz Ansaldo at the Port Recluse docks on Sharkhead. He'll fix you up."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL4_MI_Burke_Cape_Mission_Part1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ActiveTaskString :
"P3590523906" "Speak with Lorenz Ansaldo"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P2469551074" "Lorenz is part of the Family. They are quite good at smuggling people and goods to and from the mainland."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2331678104" "You need passage to Paragon City? Yah, I can hook you up. I got an arrangement going with Arachnos to handle any 'special deliveries' they might have between the Rogue Isles and the mainland. But that don't mean there ain't no price...<br><br>We got a lot of them Longbow agents snoopin' around the docks here lookin' for contraband. I was planning on getting a few of my boys ready to beat some sense into them, but then you happen to show up! Take down all the Longbow agents snoopin' around our warehouse here at the docks and destroy any crates of contraband they may have found."

