"P2059096272" "Lorenz is allowed to make such demands of you in trade for his services. I suggest you do as he says."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P2430359767" "Longbow constantly looks for evidence to shutdown Family smuggling operations in the Rogue Isles. It's time to convince Longbow to mind their own business!"

