// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL6_MI_Burke_Aura_Mission 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - MysticArtifacts 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P2387040854" "Mystic Artifacts"
// DetailString :
"P2145357933" "This set of ornate jewellry practically glows with arcane energies. You will need to offer up the mystic power to the Powers in order to unlock your power as a destined one!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P2098482234" "So you're back again, {VillainName}! I hear you've been tearing up to the streets of the Rogue Isles! But that's not what you're here for, is it? Nah, you've probably heard something about 'unlocking the true power of the Destined One' or something. Well I'll tell you, I don't buy it.  But if you're still interested in pursuing this, I can hook you up with someone who can help you with it.<br><br>There is a powerful and ancient Archmage known as Tarixus who lairs on Sharkhead Isle. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Speak with him about unlocking your potential energies.</A>"
// HeadlineString :
"P3902434528" "Unlock power of destined one"
// SendOffString :
"P1367658746" "Archmage Tarixus can be found in Potter's Field on Sharkhead Isle."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL6_MI_Burke_Aura_Mission_Part1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ActiveTaskString :
"P3851199428" "Speak with Archmage Tarixus"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3142356532" "Have you spoken with Tarixus yet? He will be able to aid you in unlocking the power of the destined one."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P153114045" "I sensed your arrival, {VillainName}. You seek to follow your destiny and show to everyone you are truly marked by the Powers for greatness. To do this you must give proper homage to the Powers, the great mystical entities who grant power to those who know how to unlock their secrets. To give proper homage to the Powers you must sacrifice arcane energies at a nexus, one of the places where the veil between this world and the mystic planes is weak.<br><br>There is a group known as the Carnival of Shadows who occasionally dabble in the arcane. They have acquired some of my artifacts in order to work their chaos magic. If you recover these magical artifacts, I will allow you to use them to unlock your energies as a destined one - if that is indeed what you are. Magical orders such as the Circle of Thorns often built great temples around nexus points in order to tap into their power and to draw energies from the Powers. Go now to find the artifacts, then offer up their arcane energies to the Powers upon an Orenbegan altar!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL6_MI_Burke_Aura_Mission_Part2 
